{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37376","headline":"感物二首 一 · 唐彦谦","name":"感物二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"騄骥初失羣，亦自矜趫腾。\n俛仰岁时久，帖然困蚊蝇。\n豪鲸逸其穴，尺水成沧溟。\n岂无鱼鼈交，望望爲所憎。\n物理有翕张，达人同废兴。\n幸无怵迫忧，聊复曲吾肱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}